@title Numbering centre: wire, device and I/O numbering as tiles
@area Layout
# Lane V4h (docs/design/visual-redesign.md section 6). Edit > Numbering... opens one window
# with what Edit > Wire numbers and Edit > Renumber held; Edit no longer has those two submenus.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text Edit #1
wait 6
shot edit-menu-one-numbering-row
expect "Numbering..."
click_text "Numbering..."
wait 10
shot centre-open
expect "Wires"
expect "Devices and points"
expect "Choose an action"
check_layout
click_text "Renumber devices"
wait 6
shot centre-picked-devices
expect "Gives the devices new tags in order"
check_layout
text interruption
wait 8
shot centre-search-interruption
expect "Number interruption points"
expect_not "Renumber devices"
check_layout
key Escape
wait 6
expect_not "Choose an action"
